  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Shrimp Fra Diavolo",
  "description": "Shrimp fra diavolo is a spicy, flavorful tomato sauce with white wine and herbs that&#39;s perfect served over pasta for a popular Italian dish.",
  "authors": [
